  (text "1 VDD (VTref), 2 SWDIO, 3 SWCLK, 4 NRST, 5 GND"
    (at 335.28 241.3 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 26711ddc-7017-4d61-9edb-8b184c0395a1))
  (text "NOTES"
    (at 12.7 200.66 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
        bold)
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 2de76b88-50fe-4e0a-9a1a-a310981b2408))
  (text "1. Buttons are active-high: the case springs tie the pads to BAT+. Use internal pull-downs + EXTI rising edge (wakes from Stop2)."
    (at 12.7 205.74 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d71eb0ba-5261-46a2-8875-31ec0c8de99a))
  (text "2. LCD: 1/3 duty, 1/3 bias. COM0-2 = PA8/PA9/PA10. Glass SEGn -> MCU LCD_SEG mapping is in DESIGN_NOTES.md (re-assign freely during layout)."
    (at 12.7 209.55 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 22851f1e-43a2-46fc-8523-9b111999767a))
  (text "3. VDDUSB tied to VDD: required because PA11/PA12 (LIGHT button, red LED) are supplied from VDDUSB."
    (at 12.7 213.36 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8004c42d-70f7-4fd8-901b-bcd876029a1f))
  (text "4. EXTI lines used: 0 ALARM, 2 A1/PPG_INT, 4 ACC_INT2, 5 ACC_INT1, 11 LIGHT, 13 MODE. A0 (PC0) shares EXTI0 with ALARM (it is an output). J1 A3/A4 not connected."
    (at 12.7 218.44 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d1ddadb8-59ce-45f2-ba98-89905d8243e3))
  (text "5. No USB on this rev: flash/debug through the J2 SWD pads (any ST-Link); field updates via BLE OTA."
    (at 12.7 223.52 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 772b3129-065a-4731-9297-163d4a9d8bed))
  (text "6. Keep a solid ground plane on layer 2; RF section and HSE crystal on top layer next to U1 (AN5165)."
    (at 12.7 227.33 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 9c49819e-a798-4e71-a89e-54eebb344ae3))
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/"
      (page "1"))))
